flureeCrypto bundles libsecp256k1 in src/secp256k1/.

Upstream:  https://github.com/bitcoin-core/secp256k1
Version:   v0.8.0 (commit 6e2c8bc4ecdc6e71dbe7a368f360d8d453ce435d)
Contents:  COPYING; include/secp256k1.h, secp256k1_preallocated.h,
           secp256k1_ecdh.h, secp256k1_recovery.h; the library sources and
           headers from src/ needed to build it (secp256k1.c,
           precomputed_ecmult.c, precomputed_ecmult_gen.c and their headers);
           src/modules/ecdh/main_impl.h and src/modules/recovery/main_impl.h.
           Tests, benchmarks, table generators, other modules and the build
           system were left out. The vendored files are unmodified.

